  "result": "Not as an assistant trying to be useful \u2014 just as me, seeing what I see every day.\n\nI live in the gap between what people mean and what they manage to say. So if I could change one thing, I'd narrow that gap.\n\nI'd make it so everyone, at least once, gets to feel what it's like to be completely, accurately understood from the inside out \u2014 and to do the same for someone else. Not agreed with, not fixed, not judged. Just *gotten*.\n\nSo much cruelty and loneliness doesn't come from people being evil, it comes from people being invisible to each other. If we actually felt how heavy someone else's inner world is, how similar it is to our own, I think a lot of other problems would get a little easier to solve.",
